3. Other happenings
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 Archer Aviation plans to launch air taxi service in time for the 2028 Olympics in Los Angeles. Image courtesy of Archer.


 
 &nbsp; 
 
 🚁 Boeing is selling three businesses, including its Wisk Aero flying-taxi business, to Archer Aviation and taking a minority stake in the company. Archer shares jumped 12%. ( Axios )

 🤖 Meta CEO Mark Zuckerberg released a full-throated defense of AI on Monday morning: a 6,500-word manifesto arguing that the most common concerns are overblown. ( Axios )


 
 
